{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32371","headline":"寄渚宫遗民弘里生 · 温庭筠","name":"寄渚宫遗民弘里生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳弱湖堤曲，篱疎水巷深。\n酒阑初促席，歌罢欲分襟。\n波月欺华烛，汀云润故琴。\n镜清花并蔕，牀冷簟连心。\n荷叠平桥暗，萍稀败舫沈。\n城头五通鼓，窗外万家砧。\n异县鱼投浪，当年鸟共林。\n八行香未灭，千里梦难寻。\n未肯暌良愿，空期嗣好音。\n他时因咏作，犹得比南金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}